  "_about": "The plans each tool's onboarding offers, one home for them. core/onboarding/<tool>/02-plan.md renders its tool's list with {{plans}}. meter: share (a usage limit that resets), usd (billed per token) or free (a local model). meter_cmd: what shows the meter, or null when no command in the tool does. meter_cmd_confirmed: true when the tool's docs or a run confirm that command shows the meter, false when that is unconfirmed (the walkthrough then says so), null with a null meter_cmd. pay_past_limit: possible (paid credits can be turned on), unknown (not confirmed either way), or n/a (no limit to pay past). provider: the provider id the tool itself uses.",
